Z||000020||artherd||07-13-2001||05:16 AM||||I just use my OIL SLICK!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Heh, seriously, mid-engine-nes and general 2.8-pushrod-crappiness limits the burnout abilities of most fieros.<P>Archie had a shot of his white IMSA doing some agressive testing while leaving the shop a while back  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>We will see how the northstar engine fares, somewhat better I am hoping! ;P)<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
